WEBVTT

00:18.160 --> 00:21.600
RULES OF PANTANAWITTAYA SCHOOL

00:21.680 --> 00:26.040
Someone says everything has its own rules.

00:27.840 --> 00:32.000
And every rule is for the common good.

00:32.680 --> 00:34.360
HEADMASTER
HEAD OF STUDENT WELFARE

00:34.440 --> 00:36.480
But the rulemakers

00:36.560 --> 00:38.880
have never exercised them with integrity.

00:42.440 --> 00:45.440
Many times, we find that the rules

00:45.960 --> 00:47.520
turn into a weight

00:47.600 --> 00:48.960
that suppresses us

00:50.160 --> 00:52.000
to be under its authority.

00:55.000 --> 00:57.320
RULES OF PANTANAWITTAYA SCHOOL

00:57.880 --> 00:59.440
It's time for a change.

03:06.160 --> 03:09.040
Hello. My name is Nanno.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.560
It's nice meeting you all.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.920
Go sit over there, Nanno.

03:25.880 --> 03:27.880
I'm Nanno. What's your name?

03:28.800 --> 03:29.920
Excuse me.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.520
Coming here in the middle of the semester,

03:32.600 --> 03:34.880
you have to pay more attention
in class, Nanno.

03:38.000 --> 03:42.160
Students, turn your book
to lesson 4, page 128.

03:46.240 --> 03:48.360
Hey, my name is Mie.

03:59.720 --> 04:00.920
What is that?

04:02.840 --> 04:04.680
Nothing, I just dropped a pen.

04:05.240 --> 04:09.680
Be careful, Mie. If you do that,
other people will lose focus.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.880
Yes, ma'am. I'm sorry.

04:15.520 --> 04:16.520
Nanno.

04:25.640 --> 04:28.760
Today, the Administrative Department
will randomly check your belongings.

04:28.840 --> 04:29.800
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am.

04:38.480 --> 04:43.760
Isn't an obsolete protocol like this
a violation of privacy?

04:54.440 --> 04:56.080
The more ancient it is, the better it is.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.760
Ancient things are tested over time.

05:01.600 --> 05:03.000
And as this school's rule says,

05:03.080 --> 05:07.080
the students must follow
the teachers' orders strictly.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.120
So, violation or not,

05:10.760 --> 05:12.240
I'll be the judge of that.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.080
I hope you don't have any problems.

05:26.240 --> 05:27.280
Yes, ma'am.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.480
Thank you, Teacher B.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.160
My pleasure, Teacher A.

05:52.160 --> 05:53.800
Let's continue our lesson.

05:54.480 --> 05:57.640
The French Revolution took place

05:57.720 --> 06:00.600
-during the reign of Louis XVI.
-Nanno!

06:00.680 --> 06:03.760
It was the time of change back then.

06:03.840 --> 06:05.800
-Nanno!
-There was an economic crisis…

06:21.360 --> 06:22.920
Dear beloved students,

06:23.720 --> 06:26.440
the thing that makes
Pantanawittaya grow strong

06:26.520 --> 06:28.840
as a pillar in the society,

06:28.920 --> 06:30.720
is having discipline.

06:30.800 --> 06:32.640
The teachers' goal

06:32.720 --> 06:35.640
is to see the students
become good people and do good.

06:35.720 --> 06:38.120
And what helps you achieve your goal

06:38.200 --> 06:41.640
in a world full of temptation

06:41.720 --> 06:43.560
is discipline.

06:51.760 --> 06:53.680
So, when it comes to boarding school,

06:54.160 --> 06:56.560
the teachers can make any rules they want?

06:56.640 --> 07:00.680
Yes. Here, they do
more than what you think, Nanno.

07:00.760 --> 07:04.080
Nanno, you have to be
very careful, you know.

07:04.160 --> 07:07.760
The teachers at school
dislike people like you the most.

07:08.320 --> 07:09.240
People like me?

07:09.320 --> 07:13.160
Like, people who like to question.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.520
That's a no-no.

07:17.440 --> 07:18.880
It's not funny, Nanno.

07:21.880 --> 07:25.120
Did you see that
there were two empty desks in our class?

07:25.200 --> 07:26.720
Do you know why that is?

07:28.080 --> 07:29.720
Are they sick?

07:29.800 --> 07:32.080
Those belonged to New and Jelly.

07:32.160 --> 07:36.560
The other day Jelly argued that
what Teacher B taught was wrong.

07:36.640 --> 07:41.000
And Teacher B was not happy about it,
so she threw a board eraser at Jelly.

07:46.080 --> 07:48.120
Sorry, it slipped.

07:50.520 --> 07:53.600
And what are you all waiting for?
Take Jelly to the infirmary.

07:57.240 --> 08:01.000
And New, he was recording the video,
intending to post it and expose Teacher B.

08:01.640 --> 08:03.520
But she caught him first.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.280
Do you know what happened to those two?

08:09.280 --> 08:11.760
Both of them are being held
in the Room of Repentance

08:11.840 --> 08:14.200
by the Administrative Department teachers.

08:14.280 --> 08:17.560
It's been two days.
No one has gotten out yet.

08:17.640 --> 08:19.160
I don't know how they're doing.

08:21.280 --> 08:22.960
The Room of Repentance?

08:24.520 --> 08:28.000
Sounds fun.
Let's go hang out there, shall we, Mie?

08:28.640 --> 08:32.080
Are you out of your mind, Nanno?
That room is scary.

08:32.160 --> 08:35.920
The brash ones got in there
and went out tame.

08:36.000 --> 08:38.280
No one wants to enter that room.

08:43.159 --> 08:44.600
Teacher A is here.

08:55.400 --> 08:56.640
You're Nanno?

08:56.720 --> 08:57.560
Yes, ma'am.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.320
You know, don't you?

09:13.880 --> 09:16.880
That we are very strict
with the school rules here.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.440
Yes, I do.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.920
That's good.

09:21.400 --> 09:24.920
Since you're a new student,
we'll give you a light punishment.

09:27.000 --> 09:31.000
You must recite the 427 rules
of this school and know them by heart.

09:34.840 --> 09:36.040
Thank you.

09:36.600 --> 09:37.800
Not here.

09:46.200 --> 09:48.120
RULES OF PANTANAWITTAYA SCHOOL

10:20.960 --> 10:24.080
"The rules for students
of Pantanawittaya School,

10:24.640 --> 10:27.160
established in 1892."

10:31.640 --> 10:34.160
-Is this against the rule?
-"Rule one. All students…"

10:34.240 --> 10:37.120
But there's no rule
forbidding laughing at the school rule.

10:40.400 --> 10:42.200
-What is she doing?
-Has she gone mad?

10:42.280 --> 10:43.480
"Rule two."

10:49.200 --> 10:51.080
-"Rule three…"
-I think we should call Teacher A.

11:15.800 --> 11:16.920
-Shit!
-What is she doing?

11:30.360 --> 11:31.600
-Holy shit.
-Shit.

11:31.680 --> 11:33.000
That's the school rules.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.000
Damn.

11:43.800 --> 11:48.320
I've read all 427 rules.

11:48.400 --> 11:51.960
There isn't one saying
one shall not burn the rule book.

11:54.360 --> 11:56.360
Take her to the Room of Repentance.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.800
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am.

12:02.040 --> 12:03.480
My goodness.

12:04.880 --> 12:06.640
This looks mysterious.

12:07.200 --> 12:09.520
Will I be murdered?

12:29.960 --> 12:32.120
Dear lovely students…

12:32.680 --> 12:33.720
Lovely yet?

12:38.480 --> 12:41.280
Teacher, please let me out.
I have repented.

12:41.360 --> 12:43.800
I promise I won't argue
with the teachers anymore.

12:43.880 --> 12:45.840
Please let me out.

12:46.560 --> 12:49.320
We always welcome the repented.

12:49.800 --> 12:51.680
And once you've repented,

12:51.760 --> 12:54.400
you're our valuable personnel.

12:55.840 --> 12:59.920
Jelly, you're ready to be back in society.

13:00.480 --> 13:01.960
Thank you very much, Teacher A.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.720
And how about you, New?

13:04.800 --> 13:06.440
Have you thought it through?

13:08.200 --> 13:09.480
I'm not guilty.

13:09.560 --> 13:11.680
I just wanted to post
what really happened.

13:12.640 --> 13:15.640
But that defames
the teachers and the school.

13:16.160 --> 13:18.520
Teacher B was teaching incorrectly
and she didn't accept it.

13:18.600 --> 13:20.160
And also, she hurt Jelly.

13:21.160 --> 13:25.160
New, just play along,
so we can both get out.

13:25.240 --> 13:28.320
But it's not right. I won't take it.

13:29.040 --> 13:30.880
Are we going to put up with this?

13:30.960 --> 13:33.920
If you think so,
I'll have no other way out for you.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.800
Then I want to quit this school.

13:37.320 --> 13:38.160
Quit?

13:38.800 --> 13:41.320
Do you think by doing that,
everything will come to an end?

13:43.600 --> 13:47.600
Do you know that handling
stubborn ones like you is so easy?

13:47.680 --> 13:52.040
We can just put your name
on the unpleasant list

13:52.120 --> 13:53.440
and publicize it.

13:55.440 --> 14:01.120
Just by doing that, your chances
of admission to schools, universities,

14:01.200 --> 14:03.320
or any companies will be gone.

14:04.840 --> 14:07.760
But… you have no right to do that.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.680
Of course, I do.

14:09.680 --> 14:11.280
And I've done it before.

14:12.760 --> 14:16.000
In the outside world,
there are systems supporting each other.

14:16.080 --> 14:17.440
And how about you?

14:17.920 --> 14:20.920
Are you ready to face the future
that you've chosen?

14:22.560 --> 14:25.320
Be agreeable, so we can get out.

14:26.520 --> 14:28.080
Tell me again.

14:28.160 --> 14:29.920
Do you still want to quit?

14:34.160 --> 14:35.200
I'm sorry, ma'am.

14:37.520 --> 14:38.520
What?

14:40.080 --> 14:42.480
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

14:42.560 --> 14:45.360
From now on, I won't post anything
that may defame the school.

15:03.720 --> 15:04.600
Thank you.

15:10.040 --> 15:13.720
When New first came here,
he made the same expression as you.

15:15.400 --> 15:19.080
Spend this time repenting.

15:19.560 --> 15:24.880
And I still insist you recite every rule
and know it by heart.

15:31.560 --> 15:36.880
The rules for students
of Pantanawittaya School,

15:36.960 --> 15:41.320
established in 1892.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.400
Rule one,

15:44.200 --> 15:51.080
students shall respect
and strictly follow the school rules.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.720
Rule two,

15:53.800 --> 15:58.240
students shall respect the teachers

15:58.320 --> 16:00.040
as their own relatives,

16:00.120 --> 16:03.960
and always be grateful to them.

16:31.680 --> 16:33.640
-Teacher A, we have a problem!
-Teacher A, we have a problem!

16:35.360 --> 16:38.560
Nanno, didn't you get punished
at all yesterday?

16:40.280 --> 16:43.360
They just let me listen
to the 427 rules of the school,

16:43.840 --> 16:45.880
repeatedly, in a dark room.

16:46.680 --> 16:47.960
And weren't you scared at all?

16:48.480 --> 16:50.960
Take a look at Jelly.
She's a different person now.

16:53.920 --> 16:55.000
See?

16:56.320 --> 16:58.160
New is still sick
and hasn't come to school yet.

16:59.960 --> 17:03.880
I didn't let her out. How did she get out?

17:04.840 --> 17:08.800
For me, I was just bored

17:09.560 --> 17:10.520
and…

17:11.480 --> 17:12.839
annoyed by the noise.

17:14.680 --> 17:16.800
Teacher B, you smoke, right?

17:25.599 --> 17:27.560
But it's not that scary.

17:28.079 --> 17:29.839
If everyone breaks the rules,

17:30.520 --> 17:33.160
we can all be partying
in the Room of Repentance.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.360
Hey.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.080
Stand up.

17:44.520 --> 17:48.240
I guess I'll be partying alone
in the Room of Repentance.

18:09.520 --> 18:12.800
I know all 427 school rules by heart.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.000
Rule one,

18:14.080 --> 18:17.360
students shall respect
and strictly follow the school rules.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.280
Rule two,

18:18.360 --> 18:19.720
students shall respect the teachers

18:19.800 --> 18:21.680
as their own relatives
and be grateful to them.

18:21.760 --> 18:22.680
Rule three…

18:22.760 --> 18:26.520
I'll ask you one more time.
Who in the world are you?

18:27.080 --> 18:30.240
I'm Nanno. Nanno, the new student.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.680
Have you forgotten?

18:34.760 --> 18:36.600
I also want to know…

18:36.680 --> 18:38.600
how long you can put up with this.

18:42.000 --> 18:45.200
Welcome to the Room of Repentance, Nanno.

18:59.920 --> 19:02.960
The atmosphere here is so aesthetic.

20:12.200 --> 20:13.120
Who are you?

20:13.920 --> 20:17.000
I'm Nanno. Why do you keep
asking me the same question?

20:18.920 --> 20:20.320
What exactly do you want?

20:20.400 --> 20:23.160
Wow, a new question.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.200
What I want…

20:27.160 --> 20:30.360
I want Teacher B to admit
that what she taught was wrong.

20:30.440 --> 20:31.640
And for you, Teacher A to admit

20:31.720 --> 20:33.160
that you're the one
who put the cigarettes in my pocket.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.240
And, for the Headmaster

20:34.320 --> 20:37.400
to admit that
the students' welfare here sucks.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.600
If I get them all, I'll be satisfied.

20:41.000 --> 20:43.040
Still young, yet so rebellious.

20:43.600 --> 20:44.960
Open her mouth.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.600
So defiant, are you?

21:00.080 --> 21:02.240
Wrath is one of the sins.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.480
Don't get angry, Teacher A.

21:05.080 --> 21:07.600
We should remain virtuous.

21:07.680 --> 21:10.320
Oh, or should this rule
apply to students only?

22:08.600 --> 22:09.680
Excuse me.

22:18.480 --> 22:21.960
My name is Yuri.
It's my first day of school here.

22:22.600 --> 22:25.240
I would like to enlist
as a truant patrol here.

22:30.480 --> 22:33.120
Look at you. You, on truant patrol?

22:35.040 --> 22:38.080
For me, rules are for the common good.

22:38.760 --> 22:41.360
Following rules means
doing things for the common good.

22:41.440 --> 22:43.640
I would like to be of your assistance.

22:44.400 --> 22:47.920
And more importantly, I used to study
in the same school as Nanno.

22:48.000 --> 22:50.200
I know how to deal with her.

23:00.600 --> 23:01.680
What is this?

23:02.160 --> 23:05.520
I heard that there's a LINE group
for rule-breaking arrangements.

23:06.080 --> 23:08.120
So, I created a fake account
and joined the group.

23:08.960 --> 23:11.240
That way, we'll get them
before they break the rules.

23:19.120 --> 23:21.120
-Go, to the front, go!
-Get over here.

23:21.720 --> 23:23.560
Down! On your knees.

23:23.640 --> 23:25.440
-Arms behind your heads.
-Hands up.

23:25.920 --> 23:28.560
Damn, how did they know?

23:28.640 --> 23:30.400
There must be a mole.

23:32.280 --> 23:36.040
Hey, do we really have to stay here
until tomorrow?

23:36.120 --> 23:37.320
What's your name?

23:37.800 --> 23:39.040
Sittichai, ma'am.

23:39.120 --> 23:41.200
-Which class?
-Grade 12, Room 5, ma'am.

23:41.680 --> 23:43.440
-And you?
-Peerapat, ma'am.

23:43.520 --> 23:45.520
-Which class?
-Grade 10, Room 2, ma'am.

23:46.360 --> 23:47.680
Thanks, Yuri.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.880
You did very well today.

23:52.680 --> 23:54.200
You can go take a rest.

23:55.480 --> 23:57.760
May I take that folder to your room?

24:33.160 --> 24:34.720
Headmaster, please.

24:39.440 --> 24:41.080
Have you all repented?

24:41.720 --> 24:43.520
-Yes, we have.
-Yes, we have.

24:43.600 --> 24:46.040
I asked if you've repented or not.

24:46.520 --> 24:48.560
-Yes, we have repented.
-Yes, we have repented.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.600
Very well.

24:50.520 --> 24:53.120
We always have a place
for the ones who repent.

24:53.200 --> 24:56.320
From now on, the ones who do wrong

24:56.400 --> 24:58.320
will be severely punished.

24:58.960 --> 25:03.880
I'm asking you all to follow
the school rules accordingly and steadily,

25:03.960 --> 25:06.560
and not to be tempted
by the external factors.

25:07.400 --> 25:11.200
All right. Everyone.
Go back to your classes.

25:53.160 --> 25:54.360
This is very kind of you.

25:55.440 --> 25:58.080
Nanno, you're being sluggish as always.

25:58.160 --> 26:00.640
You're still good at
being two-faced as always.

26:01.120 --> 26:03.560
So what's the plan this time?

26:40.440 --> 26:41.920
Stop it, Nanno.

26:44.600 --> 26:46.400
What do you think you're doing?

26:48.080 --> 26:50.040
I just want everyone to see

26:50.760 --> 26:55.080
how the rule keepers break the rules.

27:37.280 --> 27:39.160
Look at the camera, Teacher A.

27:41.560 --> 27:43.320
What are you doing, Yuri?

27:44.280 --> 27:47.440
If you take one step closer,
I'll send this video to everyone now.

27:48.400 --> 27:50.040
What exactly do you want?

27:51.600 --> 27:53.480
Can I have those papers, please?

28:05.320 --> 28:08.520
The school's sum of received donations
and the educational budget

28:08.600 --> 28:10.480
from the Department.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.480
This is pretty interesting.

28:12.560 --> 28:16.320
But… I haven't seen any foreign teachers.

28:18.560 --> 28:21.200
There's not even one computer.

28:22.000 --> 28:24.000
And the school lunches suck.

28:24.640 --> 28:27.200
So, where did all the money go?

28:27.280 --> 28:29.720
Don't be fooled by Nanno.

28:29.800 --> 28:32.280
Those papers are fake.

28:34.560 --> 28:38.280
If they're fake, then they're useless.

28:38.360 --> 28:39.840
Let's throw them away.

29:02.680 --> 29:03.840
Oops!

29:10.520 --> 29:11.480
Look. She's up there.

29:15.600 --> 29:16.520
You…

29:17.000 --> 29:18.760
There she is. Go get her.

29:18.840 --> 29:21.560
I think the important thing for you now
is to run away, isn't it?

29:21.640 --> 29:23.160
She's over there. Hurry!

29:24.040 --> 29:26.400
-Hurry up! Go get her!
-Come on.

29:26.480 --> 29:28.880
Hurry up and follow her.

29:28.960 --> 29:30.400
-Hurry up!
-Let's go.

31:29.760 --> 31:31.080
Sorry, Nanno.

31:31.960 --> 31:35.440
But if I want to end the game,
one needs to be sacrificed, right?

32:00.080 --> 32:02.720
Dear revered teachers,

32:02.800 --> 32:04.800
we'd like to announce that

32:04.880 --> 32:08.560
we're no longer subject to
the school rules from now on.

32:13.680 --> 32:15.560
How dare you?

32:20.400 --> 32:21.800
So what are we going to do next?

32:22.960 --> 32:26.000
Right. What shall we do?

32:27.520 --> 32:30.280
Shall we force them
to write their confession?

32:31.520 --> 32:34.080
About the wrong things
they've done in their lives?

32:34.800 --> 32:37.000
Then, we'll expose them to outsiders.

32:42.600 --> 32:43.440
Good.

32:43.520 --> 32:44.560
Yes, that's good.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.880
You heard her.

32:47.960 --> 32:50.080
-Write your confession!
-Bring them over.

32:50.160 --> 32:51.960
Hurry up! Go!

32:52.040 --> 32:53.720
Bring them over here.

32:53.800 --> 32:56.960
-Come on.
-Get writing.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.440
Go on!

32:58.520 --> 33:01.120
Make them pay for what they've done to us.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.280
Write it down.

33:05.760 --> 33:07.560
-Start writing.
-Write everything down.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.840
Are you done? Hurry up.

33:20.840 --> 33:23.080
Write down your confession.

33:25.560 --> 33:28.280
YOU ALL WILL REPENT
AND PAY FOR WHAT YOU'VE DONE.

33:44.400 --> 33:46.360
Don't you know how to write?

33:47.320 --> 33:48.680
Can you not write it down?

33:49.360 --> 33:52.160
You can't write in on your own?
I'll make you write it.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.720
Write it down. You threatened me.

33:55.440 --> 33:57.680
You can't write it down?

33:57.760 --> 33:59.760
I'll help you write it down.

34:00.720 --> 34:02.960
What you've done to me?

34:03.040 --> 34:04.760
What did you do?

34:04.840 --> 34:07.480
-Write it down.
-Forced me to starve.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.960
Forced me to lie.

34:10.600 --> 34:12.040
Forced me to starve.

34:12.120 --> 34:14.719
Write all of them down.
What you did to me.

34:14.800 --> 34:17.199
Do you have any regrets? Write it now!

34:17.280 --> 34:18.560
Write it!

34:30.639 --> 34:32.880
Shit! What should we do?

34:40.960 --> 34:41.800
Fuck you, New.

34:42.880 --> 34:45.199
You're the one who choked her to death.

34:47.480 --> 34:50.280
How could you blame only me?
You, you, and you did it too.

34:50.360 --> 34:52.320
We just helped to hold her earlier.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.120
We didn't strangle her like you did.

34:54.199 --> 34:55.239
Right.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.360
Seriously,

34:56.440 --> 34:58.600
I didn't agree to this shit,

34:59.360 --> 35:01.520
but I was afraid
that I'd be called "ignorant."

35:01.600 --> 35:03.320
What if I got attacked instead, then what?

35:03.880 --> 35:05.160
Right. It's you, New!

35:05.240 --> 35:06.520
This is all your fault.

35:06.600 --> 35:09.840
-How will you take responsibility?
-It's your fault!

35:09.920 --> 35:11.480
You killed a teacher.

35:11.560 --> 35:13.240
It's your fault, New!

35:14.680 --> 35:16.000
You all did it too.

35:16.080 --> 35:18.200
-What are we going to do now?
-This is on you!

35:39.040 --> 35:41.240
I'll give you all one last chance.

35:41.800 --> 35:45.000
If you're willing to stop,
I'll forgive you all for what you did,

35:45.080 --> 35:47.880
including the murder of Teacher A.

36:03.120 --> 36:04.760
Don't give up just yet, guys.

36:05.280 --> 36:07.760
Isn't this the path we've chosen?

36:10.560 --> 36:14.720
If we give up,
we'll become like these teachers.

36:14.800 --> 36:15.720
Take a look.

36:30.040 --> 36:31.240
I think it's enough, Mie.

36:35.640 --> 36:38.880
Guys, take the ones who don't repent.

36:48.800 --> 36:51.320
Everything is back to normal.

36:51.400 --> 36:53.240
All right, my beloved students.

36:54.160 --> 36:57.880
As you know,
we've been at peace for a long time

36:57.960 --> 37:02.800
under the benevolent school rules,

37:03.360 --> 37:04.600
until there was

37:05.400 --> 37:09.400
a new student who brought
filthy thoughts to cause chaos,

37:09.480 --> 37:11.920
and cause trouble for our school.

37:13.200 --> 37:14.840
Are we going to let the new student

37:14.920 --> 37:17.680
cause division among us?

37:22.840 --> 37:25.400
You all were brainwashed
by the new student, weren't you?

37:31.840 --> 37:35.280
Those who think Yuri is responsible
for all this, raise your hands!

37:49.960 --> 37:52.760
Excellent, my beloved students.

37:54.040 --> 37:56.080
Now that you all have repented,

37:56.760 --> 38:01.480
I would like you all to come out
and prove your loyalty,

38:02.120 --> 38:05.120
by eradicating the provocateur

38:05.680 --> 38:07.560
from our school.

38:07.640 --> 38:11.920
And make sure that she will never
come back to cause any trouble here.

38:21.440 --> 38:23.800
Let this blade be the proof.

38:23.880 --> 38:27.880
Which of us are
the true students of our school?

38:31.200 --> 38:35.000
New, I think you're the first one
suitable to prove it.

38:35.600 --> 38:36.680
Take it.

38:37.880 --> 38:41.720
You wouldn't want to end up in jail
for killing Teacher A, would you?

38:43.280 --> 38:44.760
Have you forgotten that

38:45.600 --> 38:47.640
the one who started all this was Nanno?

38:47.720 --> 38:50.480
That's a lie. Nanno's dead now.

38:50.560 --> 38:52.280
Why are you still blaming her?

39:07.920 --> 39:09.400
It's time to work.

39:20.880 --> 39:22.400
-Shit.
-What's going on?

39:22.480 --> 39:25.000
Everyone! Remain calm!

39:28.520 --> 39:32.280
Hey, it's Nanno.

39:34.280 --> 39:38.560
Greetings, teachers
and beloved fellow classmates.

39:39.520 --> 39:41.320
Did you miss me?

39:54.520 --> 39:55.640
Shit!

39:57.880 --> 39:59.400
-Look!
-What's all this?

40:01.200 --> 40:03.200
Everyone! Silence!

40:15.080 --> 40:19.200
Right now, it seems like there are
more Nannos than what you can handle.

40:27.600 --> 40:28.560
Nanno.

40:30.400 --> 40:33.680
Have you forgotten that I have a gun?

40:35.200 --> 40:36.640
I want to know

40:37.200 --> 40:41.600
if your gun has enough bullets
to shoot all of the Nannos.

40:54.400 --> 40:56.400
We do have weapons too, Headmaster.

40:58.560 --> 41:02.480
Right now, we're live
from Pantanawittaya School.

41:02.560 --> 41:05.240
And this is our school's headmaster.

41:23.960 --> 41:25.960
Hey, it's me, my lovely students.

41:26.040 --> 41:29.560
Put them down, my love. Put them down.

41:29.640 --> 41:31.560
It's me. Put them down.

41:31.640 --> 41:33.440
I fucking order you to put them down!

41:35.080 --> 41:36.960
I fucking order you to put them down!

41:38.640 --> 41:40.040
I fucking order you to stop!

41:50.800 --> 41:51.880
Shoot.

42:02.240 --> 42:03.200
Shoot me!

42:11.800 --> 42:12.680
Fuck!

42:17.160 --> 42:20.320
Headmaster, say something.

42:20.400 --> 42:22.880
Nanno, you think you've won?

42:23.600 --> 42:27.120
I've won? This is not winning.

42:27.200 --> 42:28.760
This is just the beginning.

42:41.440 --> 42:43.800
Can't you see that
your method didn't work?

42:45.160 --> 42:47.360
Are you really not letting me out?

42:48.000 --> 42:50.920
I had a hard time
looking for evidence just for you.

42:52.440 --> 42:54.160
Yuri, you're too reckless.

43:05.760 --> 43:09.120
You may find it hard to breathe here.

43:10.000 --> 43:13.080
Yes, I was locked in here for a long time.

43:13.160 --> 43:15.280
There's no phone signal here.

43:16.280 --> 43:18.320
There's no food.

43:19.720 --> 43:20.840
Who says no?

43:21.600 --> 43:23.240
There are lots of people here.

43:23.320 --> 43:25.040
If you eat one another,

43:25.560 --> 43:27.040
you can survive for a year.

43:28.160 --> 43:31.840
That's true.
So who will be the first to get eaten?

43:32.640 --> 43:35.320
Is it the black sheep?

43:45.360 --> 43:47.000
I'd better get going.

43:48.080 --> 43:49.560
I'll see you, Yuri.

43:49.640 --> 43:52.320
I'm certain that
you'll find a way to get out.

43:52.400 --> 43:53.840
You can do it!

44:17.760 --> 44:20.000
So what should we do next, Nanno?

44:23.880 --> 44:27.880
The rest is up to you all.

44:29.520 --> 44:32.840
Do you think
we can face the outside world?

45:52.600 --> 45:54.920
No matter how this story ends,

45:55.760 --> 45:59.160
white, black, or any color…

45:59.880 --> 46:04.040
who's right, who's wrong,
or who's better than whom?

46:05.360 --> 46:07.040
Can we really decide

46:08.240 --> 46:09.840
in this gray world?

47:56.040 --> 48:01.040
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
